	"system": {
		"description": "<p>Across countless worlds there’s a struggle against expanding civilization and encroaching wildlands. On many, the urbane create laws or structures to protect the natural world, or develop their technologies and buildings to be as minimally invasive as possible to maintain harmony. On others, rampant pollution and destruction of the natural world threatens the world’s very ability to support life outside of the ever-expanding cities where only vermin survive in sewers and dark alleys, the last animals that might live alongside the people there.</p><p>On these worlds, and all the worlds in between, there exist Eco-Terrorists. People who fight to protect the wild, tooth and claw, until the societies stop their rampant predations and destruction of the environment.</p><p><strong>Table: Eco-Terrorist</strong></p><table border=\"1\"><colgroup><col><col></colgroup><thead><tr style=\"text-align: center;\"><td>Level</td><td>Features</td></tr></thead><tbody><tr style=\"text-align: center;\"><td>2nd</td><td><p>@UUID[Compendium.a5e.a5e-class-features.Item.UGQDEzKn8FaTB0vm]{Blend In} @UUID[Compendium.a5e.a5e-class-features.Item.DKHCsVn2c8tYY6Et]{Protest and Inform}</p></td></tr><tr style=\"text-align: center;\"><td>6th</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.a5e.a5e-class-features.Item.To7zgQLp9S5oO0Tt]{Nature’s Retaliation}</td></tr><tr style=\"text-align: center;\"><td>10th</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.a5e.a5e-class-features.Item.ymch7oAyLkxXKvKk]{Strike Terror}</td></tr><tr style=\"text-align: center;\"><td>14th</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.a5e.a5e-class-features.Item.qSYTHRplR1n31lMK]{Protected Lands}</td></tr></tbody></table><p> </p>",
